    "text_full": "Register now for early access to concurrent writes in the Turso Cloud. Join the waitlist\n\nTurso\nDocs\nCloud Pricing\nBlog\nChangelog\nFollow us on GitHub\nFollow us on X\nJoin us on Discord\nLogin\nStart for free now\nPrivate beta starting April 2026\nSQLite, supercharged.\nData infrastructure you can trust.\n\nThe new Turso Cloud takes the world's most deployed database beyond its limits, giving your apps and AI agents high concurrency writes, full compliance, and the scale they actually need in production.\n\nJoin the beta\nLearn more\nInstant Scalability\n\nGo beyond SQLite's single-writer bottleneck with high-concurrency writes, unlimited databases per agent, and automatic geographical placement.\n\nA database you can trust\n\nBring-your-own-Key encryption (BYOK) and Bring-your-own-Cloud (BYOC) deployments. Point-in-time restore, and continuous backups, built for production and compliance.\n\nKey features\nSQLite-compatible\n\nDrop-in compatible with SQLite, the world's most deployed database, with none of the production limitations.\n\nHigh-concurrency writes\n\nOvercome SQLite's single-writer limitation and unlock high write throughput for demanding production workloads.\n\nRuns anywhere\n\nDeploy locally, in the cloud, or at the edge. Synced seamlessly across environments.\n\nUnlimited agent databases\n\nProvision independent databases for every AI agent via the REST API and pay only for what you use.\n\nBring-your-own-Cloud (BYOC)\n\nKeep all data and compute in your own AWS account. Additional cloud providers coming soon.\n\nPoint-in-time restore (PITR)\n\nContinuous backups let you roll back to any moment to recover from agent or human mistakes.\n\nBranching\n\nFork any existing database into a new branch for testing, staging, or agent experimentation.\n\nVector and Full-Text search\n\nBuilt-in similarity search and full text search so your agents can find the right context, fast.\n\nBring-your-own-Key encryption (BYOK)\n\nEncrypt every database with a key you control. Built for sensitive agentic workloads and compliance requirements.\n\nand much more!\n\nJoin the beta\nFrequently asked questions\nWhen does the beta launch?\nHow do I get access?\nWhat do I need to get started?\nHow do I give feedback or get support?\nReady to go beyond SQLite's limits?\nJoin the beta\nTurso Cloud\nQuickstart\nDocumentation\nPricing\nAPI Status\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\n \nEmbedded Replicas\nDatabase Branching\nBackups & Recovery\nPlatform API\nTurso Database\nQuickstart\nChangelog\nReleases\nCompany\nAbout\nContact Us\nSupport\nTrust\nBlog\nBrand\nRSS\nYouTube\nDiscord\nX\nLinkedin\nGitHub\n© Turso 2026"
